<title>Hoe te communiceren</title>
</head>
<body><h2><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="TrackedChange SCXW180056639 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW180056639 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">Met alles wat je tot nu toe hebt geleerd begrijp je hopelijk dat de slogan 'communicatie is de sleutel' sterk van toepassing is op </span></span><span class="TrackedChange SCXW180056639 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW180056639 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">transdisciplinaire</span></span><span class="TrackedChange SCXW180056639 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW180056639 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"> samenwerking. Maar dit is makkelijker gezegd dan gedaan. Waar moet je rekening mee houden bij communicatie?  </span></span><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW180056639 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;">Centraal staat het concept van een gemeenschappelijke taal. </span><span class="EOP SCXW180056639 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space-collapse: preserve; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;
De <b>theorie-pagina</b> en de <b>praktijk-pagina</b> helpen je verder.</span></p></h2></body>
